uest</p>", "labelEditorState": null}, {"alt": null, "type": "TEXT", "fileName": null, "imageUrl": null, "fileIdentifier": null, "textEditorState": "<p style=\"font-size:32px;\">The Winding Road to Maragoth</p>", "labelEditorState": null}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{\"text\":[{\"text\":\"The Dragon’s Tooth\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"Mr Tibbles Finds a Friend\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"One Stormy Night\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"A Flash of Brilliant Light\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"All the Diamonds in the World\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"Lemur’s Leap\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"Queen Kamela’s Quest\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"The Winding Road to Maragoth\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"}]}", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40839280, "text": "<h2>Title Ideas:</h2>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35629454, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40837105, "text": "Example Story", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 40837031, "text": null, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 43, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>The Wizard’s Elbow</strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p>With a sudden flash, Ringlewald’s second-best tunic burst into flames. He thrust his arm into the nearest oak barrel. Inside, the pink foam stopped swirling and fizzed. The fizzing grew to a slow bubbling. Ringlewald withdrew his arm and retreated. For days he’d been mixing. Nothing had happened yet. Now it worked! He’d succeeded! Bother…</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 43, "name": "Example Story", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-09T10:51:52.60968", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-09T10:51:52.60968", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35629454, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 43, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35629469, "text": "In this activity, you will be writing a story. Except this story comes with a challenge: the first sentence must be exactly ten words long, the second sentence exactly nine words, and so on until your tenth sentence is only one word long! You could write the story together or you could each write your own.\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633535148557_1image1-01FHB4C8RV6TCQ2BSD3CVHP5Z8.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35629454, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40836260, "text": "<br><br>\n<h2>What to Do:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your story title. You can invent your own or use one of the ideas below.</li>\n<li>Think of the last word in your story. This seems like a weird place to start, but this word is in a sentence all by itself and you want to make the ending really amazing, so starting with that last sentence will help. It will also give you ideas for the rest of the story.\n<li>Write your story. You can write it all in one block of text or you could put each sentence on a new line. It’s up to you!</li>\n<li>Try to avoid repetition – you don’t have many words, so make them all count by not saying the same thing twice (unless you’re doing it deliberately for a particular effect).</li>\n</ol>\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35629454, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35629922, "text": "<h2>Extra Challenge:</h2>\nTry writing a ten-word story. Can you tell the whole thing in only ten words? ", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35629454, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData":